msgstr "The AI prepared the title, summary, tags and feature suggestions."

#: ideas/ai_views.py:28
msgid ""
"AI şu an yanıt veremedi. Fikir kaydedildi; sonra tekrar deneyebilirsin."
msgstr ""
"The AI could not answer right now. The idea was saved; you can try again "
"later."

#: ideas/ai_views.py:42
#, python-brace-format
